{"title":"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For what value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> does\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/c/e0c9ec94030e09b44a3086de323084adbecfb713.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{\\sqrt{2}}\\sqrt{x}+\\log_{2}{x}+\\log_{4}{x^2}+\\log_{8}{x^3}+\\log_{16}{x^4}=40?\\]\" width=\"415\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/1/9818b87dd7bd5a34bf982c804841bb43004db4a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 8 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 16 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 32 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 256 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 1024$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"412\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/9/7498c0fe81193b08592296dd3f814d2cbcdcf655.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{\\sqrt{2}}\\sqrt{x} + \\log_2x + \\log_4(x^2) + \\log_8(x^3) + \\log_{16}(x^4)  = 40\\]\" width=\"440\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/f/f7fcc47e14a25755d1fdb4ab16fad12a4220b1f0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{2} \\frac{\\log_2x}{\\log_2\\sqrt{2}} + \\log_2x + \\frac{2\\log_2x}{\\log_24} + \\frac{3\\log_2x}{\\log_28} + \\frac{4\\log_2x}{\\log_216}  = 40\\]\" width=\"429\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/b/24b4555144e83c662e5e0d838d6e4f66a883de4f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_2x + \\log_2x + \\log_2x + \\log_2x + \\log_2x = 40\\]\" width=\"352\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/f/a0fa15d3c8038c8eeef4f27d4017db1935f5e66b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5\\log_2x = 40\\]\" width=\"97\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/9/e69d0058e5864841add8ab316c7bd9daf5355459.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_2x = 8\\]\" width=\"76\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/1/0f19d42c2e2ac72ae9ab1b20718de822d0c5a168.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = 256 \\;\\; (D)\\]\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/b/7bb5fbb1983882f2b26504726d459829b09a79ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{x^n}{y^n} = \\log_{x}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"17\" />, we see that the equation becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/1/fc109cfeffb221de0143cba74d0765c69b7aa40c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{2}{x} + \\log_{2}{x} + \\log_{2}{x} + \\log_{2}{x} + \\log_{2}{x} = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"352\" height=\"17\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/d/d8d0ca23e8570bf97dcb5c2298fa95cb7c18b202.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\log_{2}{x} = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/e/f1ed5814bac7b803f973924250caa743e5a84ec3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{2}{x} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/5/7a5a3527d92d2722c881d6b7a6eb26ae0a0a351c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2^8 = 256$\" width=\"102\" height=\"15\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/e/8de641a309fc5878c26baf699f2382b7d4b02b5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B\">2010 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>